# Naming Conventions (SHM)

### Files

- **components/ui/** (Shadcn): `kebab-case.tsx` (e.g. `button.tsx`, `card.tsx`)
- **Other components:** `kebab-case.tsx` or `PascalCase.tsx` (e.g. `sidebar.tsx`, `mini-chart.tsx`)
- **Hooks (mandatory):** `camelCase` starting with `use` (e.g. `useGoldenTemple.ts`, `useApi.ts`)
- **Utils:** `kebab-case.ts` (e.g. `auth-service.ts`); barrel: `index.ts`
- **Constants:** `kebab-case.ts` or `data.ts` (e.g. `constants/data.ts`)
- **Types:** `index.ts` in `types/` or `PascalCase.types.ts` next to component
- **Styles:** `*.module.css` or `index.css` in `styles/`
- **Tests:** `*.test.tsx`

### Folders

- **lowercase-kebab-case** (e.g. `components/user-card/`, `hooks/use-local-storage/`)
- Exception: top-level **App/** (PascalCase) is allowed

```bash
components/ui/
components/layout/
hooks/
utils/
pages/
```
